  "next_action": "Merge the DvP Phase 3 PR (branch claude/m3-dvp-phase3). Then Phase 4: run the frozen candidates (config/dvp/frozen-candidates.json) on 2025 as a conditional holdout with a frozen manifest, label each position PROMISING/INCONCLUSIVE/NOT_USEFUL/BLOCKED, write the model card, and freeze a prospective 2026 shadow test.",
  "sections": {
    "review": {
      "summary": "Read the specification's Phase B (B00-B12), sections 6-7 and 9 (forecast estimator, point-in-time vs recomputed baselines, common eligible rows, paired deltas with block bootstrap, practical minimum from development data only, decision labels, Phase 3 gate), the as-of layer (cutoffs, features_as_of, FrozenForecasts, evaluation_join, league_prior), Phase 2's lab and METHODOLOGY.md where B00 and the metrics were declared, and the reliability results that motivate the variants (D/ST k about 7-9, QB drift, RB rushing yards, touchdowns noise, carryover slopes).",
      "files": [
        "docs/research/dvp/METHODOLOGY.md",
        "docs/research/dvp/README.md",
        "scripts/model/dvp.py"
      ]
    },
    "plan": {
      "summary": "walkforward.py: fold parameters fit on training seasons only (own k by REML, prior slope by carryover, DvP k and slope from training residuals), a preweek or per-game loop over cutoffs using features_as_of, B00 and variants computed per target row from rows available by the cutoff, point-in-time residuals from earlier B00 forecasts, recomputed-baseline residuals, recency weights, last-season priors, non-touchdown components; forecasts frozen and joined to labels only through evaluation_join; metrics per position on common rows (RMSE, MAE, bias, Spearman, calibration deciles, paired delta with block bootstrap, by season and week bins). dvp.py backtest --stage development|validation: development folds 2017-2023 and tuning, then validation 2024 from a candidates file fixed after development; refuses 2025. Tests T15-T20, T22, T24, T25 on synthetic seasons. BACKTEST_REPORT.md and registry records.",
      "files": [
        "libs/arbit-model/src/arbit_model/dvp/walkforward.py",
        "libs/arbit-model/tests/test_dvp_walkforward.py",
        "scripts/model/dvp.py",
        "config/dvp/backtest.json",
        "config/dvp/frozen-candidates.json"
      ]
    },
    "implementation": {
      "summary": "walkforward.py: prepare (fails closed on unknown columns), fit_fold (training-only own k, prior slope, DvP k and slope, non-TD k), walk (preweek/per-game cutoffs via features_as_of; B00; point-in-time residual store; recomputed baselines; recency weights; last-season prior; non-TD residuals; B09 controls; frozen forecasts), evaluate (evaluation_join), metrics with block-bootstrap deltas, calibration, breakdowns, check_stage (refuses holdout). dvp.py backtest (development with selection and frozen candidates, validation from candidates, B10 and B12 sensitivity), report (plot from receipts), Phase B registry records; walkforward.py added to the code scan. Runs: development 2017-2023 (code d811711), candidates frozen (3a920c2), validation 2024 (3a920c2), report and registry.",
      "files": [
        "libs/arbit-model/src/arbit_model/dvp/walkforward.py",
