      ]
    },
    "validation": {
      "summary": "Checks: foundation, model tests (123), point-in-time, ruff check and format, mypy, the full Python suite (default threads, as CI): all exit 0. Leakage on synthetic seasons: future and own results never change a forecast (T16, T17); Thursday results reach Sunday only under per-game cutoffs (T15); fold parameters unchanged by later seasons and the holdout refused (T18); every variant covers the same rows and labels join only through evaluation_join (T19, T20); a real defense effect helps, pure noise and placebos don't (T21, T22, T24); week 1 is the prior with nothing missing (T25); planted projections fail closed (B11); forecasts reproducible (T13). Real data: development and validation receipts; placebo controls show no meaningful uplift; candidates frozen (sha 2b2ce424) before validation, recorded in the validation receipt. Report claims checked against receipts and corrected where the draft overstated (unshrunk D/ST, recency, non-TD, controls, B12 attribution).",
